{# Mira interview shows — gate-2 transcript review invite. Live send is the Worker's
   inline copy (editorial-decision approve handler); keep in sync. #}
<div style="font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;color:#1a202c;line-height:1.6">
  <p>Hi {{ guest_name }},</p>
  <p>Thank you for the time you gave me. Your episode is edited and ready, and
  nothing goes out until you have heard it and said yes.</p>
  <p><a href="{{ review_url }}" style="color:{{ brand_color }}">Listen to the episode and read the transcript</a></p>
  <p>If I don't hear from you within seven days I'll take that as approval, and
  I'll remind you at day four. You can always ask for changes after publication
  too.</p>
  {{ signature }}
</div>
